            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.53

- The lyrics now visibly spring when the line changes. The motion was correct but far too tightly damped: each line overshot its resting place by about three points, which is not enough to see. Lines now spring roughly four times further past the mark before settling, and the further a line sits from the one being sung, the more it gives.
]]></description>
